   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the development of the Bougainville Food Security Action Plan to facilitate enhancing policy adoption and implementation in the Autonomous Region of Bougainville</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the development of a concrete, budgeted Action Plan which will enable the ABG to roll out the new BFSP framework to relevant sectoral agencies and local-level governments, as a follow-up to the policy formulation phase. It would also conduct capacity-building and awareness raising activities at the constitutional level and support pilot projects in each constituency, to facilitate buy-in and incorporation of the Bougainville Food Security Policy at the constituency level.</narrative>
  </description>
